  "description": "<h3 data-end=\"180\" data-start=\"149\"><strong data-end=\"178\" data-start=\"153\">&bull; Brand Introduction:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"473\" data-start=\"181\">Grand-Pierre &Eacute;clat is a luxury skincare brand rooted in clean, natural ingredients and indulgent self-care rituals. Founded by a registered nurse, our mission is to deliver high-performance skincare that fuses nature, science, and elegance &mdash; all while empowering wellness and self-confidence.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"478\" data-start=\"475\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"512\" data-start=\"480\"><strong data-end=\"510\" data-start=\"484\">&bull; Product Description:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"824\" data-start=\"513\">We offer a curated line of skincare essentials including our bestselling <strong data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"586\">Anti-Aging Vitamin C Serum</strong>, <strong data-end=\"639\" data-start=\"618\">Dead Sea Mud Mask</strong>, <strong data-end=\"669\" data-start=\"641\">Botanical Recovery Cream</strong>, and handcrafted natural soaps. Each product is formulated to nourish, rejuvenate, and protect the skin &mdash; all wrapped in a high-end, minimalist aesthetic.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"829\" data-start=\"826\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"870\" data-start=\"831\"><strong data-end=\"868\" data-start=\"835\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1146\" data-start=\"871\">\r\n<li data-end=\"929\" data-start=\"871\">\r\n<p data-end=\"929\" data-start=\"873\">Clean, premium formulations backed by clinical insight</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"976\" data-start=\"930\">\r\n<p data-end=\"976\" data-start=\"932\">Luxurious French-Haitian inspired branding</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1021\" data-start=\"977\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1021\" data-start=\"979\">Affordable luxury with real skin results</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1077\" data-start=\"1022\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1077\" data-start=\"1024\">High-converting product pages and branded creatives</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1146\" data-start=\"1078\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1146\" data-start=\"1080\">Perfect for beauty, self-care, wellness, and lifestyle influencers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1151\" data-start=\"1148\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1179\" data-start=\"1153\"><strong data-end=\"1177\" data-start=\"1157\">&bull; Payment Terms:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1342\" data-start=\"1180\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1217\" data-start=\"1180\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1217\" data-start=\"1182\">Commissions are processed Bi-Weekly</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1218\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1220\">Payouts are made via your preferred method: <strong data-end=\"1301\" data-start=\"1264\">PayPal, Venmo, Zelle, or Cash App</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1342\" data-start=\"1304\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1342\" data-start=\"1306\">No minimum payout threshold required</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1347\" data-start=\"1344\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1379\" data-start=\"1349\"><strong data-end=\"1377\" data-start=\"1353\">&bull; Other Information:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"1404\" data-start=\"1381\"><strong data-end=\"1402\" data-start=\"1381\">Commission Tiers:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1517\" data-start=\"1405\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1424\" data-start=\"1405\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1424\" data-start=\"1407\">💎 Starter: 30%</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1446\" data-start=\"1425\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1446\" data-start=\"1427\">🌟 10+ Sales: 35%</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1484\" data-start=\"1447\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1484\" data-start=\"1449\">✨ 25+ Sales or 5K+ Followers: 40%</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1517\" data-start=\"1485\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1517\" data-start=\"1487\">👑 Invite-Only Elite Tier: 50%</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1541\" data-start=\"1519\"><strong data-end=\"1539\" data-start=\"1519\">Affiliate Perks:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1689\" data-start=\"1542\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1572\" data-start=\"1542\">\r\n<p da